WEBVTT

00:00:39.181 --> 00:00:40.599
Frank, we just ate.

00:00:40.683 --> 00:00:42.768
I can't believe you're hungry already.

00:00:42.977 --> 00:00:44.228
I'm sorry. You know what it is?

00:00:44.311 --> 00:00:46.480
It's all... Just all that
seafood just swimming around,

00:00:46.564 --> 00:00:48.440
and when I "see food..."

00:00:48.524 --> 00:00:51.318
Oh, man! I'm gone.

00:00:52.194 --> 00:00:54.488
Dracula, Dracula, Dracula!

00:00:54.572 --> 00:00:55.948
Dracula, Dracula!

00:00:56.031 --> 00:00:59.702
I get so close,
but it's almost like he's teasing me.

00:00:59.785 --> 00:01:01.996
I just, I can't stand it anymore.

00:01:02.079 --> 00:01:03.163
I have to get him!

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:17.386
Boy, that underwater volcano looked hot.

00:01:23.851 --> 00:01:24.894
Hi, Bob.

00:01:24.977 --> 00:01:28.856
Right. We promised you
we'd play ping-pong now.

00:01:29.523 --> 00:01:31.275
Dennis? Who is this?

00:01:31.984 --> 00:01:33.527
It's our friend, Bob.

00:01:33.611 --> 00:01:35.404
-Say hi, Bob.
-"Hi, Bob."

00:01:36.822 --> 00:01:38.949
Okay! Time to go play ping-pong.

00:01:39.992 --> 00:01:41.118
-Drac!
-Drac!

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:43.662
-Drac!
-Drac!

00:01:45.414 --> 00:01:47.291
Hey, boys, where's the fire?

00:01:47.708 --> 00:01:49.001
Well, Griffin here, he...

00:01:49.084 --> 00:01:50.753
-He has something to tell you.
-Me?

00:01:51.462 --> 00:01:53.756
Yeah, I got this bite on my hand,
and since, you know,

00:01:53.839 --> 00:01:56.133
you're a biting expert,
I thought you could take a look.

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:57.509
-Yeah. Come on over here.
-The light is better.

00:01:58.969 --> 00:02:00.387
Okay...

00:02:02.264 --> 00:02:03.557
Okay, what is going on?

00:02:03.641 --> 00:02:07.478
You guys are acting weirder than normal,
and your normal is pretty weird.

00:02:07.561 --> 00:02:09.480
You are not gonna believe
what we heard, but...

00:02:12.274 --> 00:02:14.485
Ericka loves the Drac

00:02:14.568 --> 00:02:16.779
She can't get enough of that Drac

00:02:16.862 --> 00:02:18.739
Yeah

00:02:18.822 --> 00:02:20.115
Drac is back

00:02:20.199 --> 00:02:21.742
He's got the Zing

00:02:21.825 --> 00:02:23.452
The Zinga-Zing

00:02:23.786 --> 00:02:26.080
I told you I don't want to upset Mavis.

00:02:26.163 --> 00:02:28.624
But what are you talking about?

00:02:28.832 --> 00:02:31.126
Okay, well, see, Frank got
hungry, so no surprise there...

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:34.964
But we swam back to the ship,
and we found Ericka raving about you.

00:02:35.047 --> 00:02:36.632
She can't live without you, buddy.

00:02:36.715 --> 00:02:37.967
It's serious!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:42.096
You can't deny the Zing, baby

00:02:42.429 --> 00:02:45.975
So, Drac, this is great. Are you gonna
make a move on the Captain, or what?

00:02:46.058 --> 00:02:47.059
Yes.

00:02:47.685 --> 00:02:49.728
Maybe? No.

00:02:50.229 --> 00:02:53.065
It's been a while.
I don't even know where to start.

00:02:53.399 --> 00:02:55.818
It's easy, Drac.
Just make some small talk.

00:02:55.901 --> 00:02:57.611
-Remember to smile.
-Look into her eyes.

00:02:57.695 --> 00:02:59.613
-Keep it casual.
-Say something funny.

00:02:59.697 --> 00:03:00.906
Ask her where her parts are from.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:02.574
And say that her wrappings look nice.

00:03:02.658 --> 00:03:04.326
-"Do you like coffins?"
-Compliment her.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:06.203
-"Your neck looks delicious."
-Here she comes.

00:03:06.286 --> 00:03:07.496
Okay, Drac, hit it.

00:03:08.914 --> 00:03:11.083
Your delicious neck wrappings
are in a nice coffin.

00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:12.876
Would you like to see my parts?

00:03:16.755 --> 00:03:18.841
Yes, I'd love to go out with you.

00:03:18.924 --> 00:03:20.050
What?

00:03:20.217 --> 00:03:21.218
What?

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:22.553
Cantina. Midnight.

00:03:22.636 --> 00:03:23.721
Don't be late.

00:03:34.773 --> 00:03:36.150
That was a close one.

00:03:39.486 --> 00:03:42.364
-Wait! Stop it, Tinkles, stop!
-Wait, Tinkles. Come back.

00:03:52.416 --> 00:03:53.709
-Tinkles, stop!
-Wait!

00:03:53.792 --> 00:03:54.835
No, no, no!

00:04:08.223 --> 00:04:09.224
Tinkles, stop!

00:04:10.059 --> 00:04:11.393
I've been found!

00:04:11.727 --> 00:04:14.480
You'll never get me, monster!

00:04:15.856 --> 00:04:16.899
Tinkles, stop.

00:04:41.548 --> 00:04:46.637
Everybody, we are pulling up
to our next stop, the Deserted Island.

00:04:47.054 --> 00:04:49.389
It's time to get "lost" on the beach,

00:04:49.473 --> 00:04:54.728
and we hope you'll "find" yourself
some fun and relaxation.

00:04:57.147 --> 00:04:58.273
Beach time!

00:04:58.357 --> 00:04:59.942
Johnny, you go set everything up.

00:05:00.025 --> 00:05:01.985
And, Dad,
you go get in line for the snow cones.

00:05:02.069 --> 00:05:04.696
You know, actually,
I was thinking you and Johnny

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.490
should spend some time together.

00:05:06.573 --> 00:05:08.992
What do you call it again? Date night?

00:05:09.243 --> 00:05:10.285
Date night?

00:05:10.452 --> 00:05:12.412
-What are you gonna do?
-Well, I thought

00:05:12.496 --> 00:05:14.623
me and the guys
would take this opportunity

00:05:14.706 --> 00:05:17.292
to spend some quality time with Dennis.

00:05:18.168 --> 00:05:19.586
Okay. That's a great idea.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.338
Come on, Johnny. Date night.

00:05:22.381 --> 00:05:23.841
Date night!

00:05:39.565 --> 00:05:40.607
Okay, here you go!

00:05:45.988 --> 00:05:47.739
-Good girl!
-I got this one.

00:05:56.665 --> 00:05:57.749
What was that?

00:05:57.833 --> 00:05:59.918
It sounds like our children.

00:06:00.294 --> 00:06:03.005
-It is our children! Run!
-Run!

00:06:03.088 --> 00:06:05.090
Please! Help! Someone!

00:06:05.174 --> 00:06:06.425
Get the parents!

00:06:07.134 --> 00:06:09.970
Frank? Would you rub
some moonscreen on my back

00:06:10.053 --> 00:06:11.305
before I get burned?

00:06:11.388 --> 00:06:14.266
Wait one second, honey. You know,
the kids buried me in the sand.

00:06:20.939 --> 00:06:22.107
Thanks, honey.

00:06:22.816 --> 00:06:24.776
-Shall we have another?
-Sure.

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:28.197
-Sounds good.
-Straight up.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.240
Isn't this place amazing?

00:06:31.074 --> 00:06:33.368
The menu is in a bottle!

00:06:33.452 --> 00:06:35.120
Genius! Isn't that awesome, honey?

00:06:37.706 --> 00:06:39.124
What? Sorry.

00:06:39.499 --> 00:06:41.001
I was just thinking about my dad.

00:06:41.501 --> 00:06:44.046
Don't you think
he's acting weird lately?

00:06:44.588 --> 00:06:47.466
Not really. Besides having
a huge crush on the Captain.

00:06:47.549 --> 00:06:49.426
-What?
-Yeah.

00:06:49.635 --> 00:06:52.137
The Love Boat is
definitely making another run.

00:06:52.221 --> 00:06:53.555
No way. He's...

00:06:54.056 --> 00:06:56.141
He's my dad.

00:06:56.266 --> 00:06:58.060
I know, right? It's weird.

00:06:58.143 --> 00:07:00.771
When my parents kiss,
I still close my eyes.

00:07:01.939 --> 00:07:06.235
I guess I never thought about him
with anyone besides my mom.

00:07:07.027 --> 00:07:09.154
You're cool with it, though, right?

00:07:09.655 --> 00:07:11.698
Of course. I want him to be happy.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:12.991
Totally.

00:07:14.952 --> 00:07:15.953
Totally.

00:07:25.629 --> 00:07:31.385
Have you a beverage
to quench me of my parchment?

00:07:31.635 --> 00:07:34.012
Yes, of course, Mr. Chupacabra.

